      "instance_name": "isis_strip_club_meme_stereotype",
      "label": "ISIS Strip Club Stereotype",
      "description": "A harmful and derogatory stereotype that portrays members of ISIS as engaging in vulgar, sexualized, or absurd behavior (e.g., a 'strip club'), reducing a complex, violent, and ideologically driven group to a crude caricature. This stereotype is used to dehumanize and mock ISIS members, often reinforcing Islamophobic tropes by implying they are primitive, sexually deviant, or incapable of rational thought.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
