      "instance_name": "hypersexualization_stereotype",
      "label": "Hypersexualization Stereotype",
      "description": "A derogatory stereotype that portrays individuals or groups as overly sexual or obsessed with sex, often used to demean or mock them. In this meme, the 'strip club' reference implies hypersexualization of ISIS members, which is a harmful and inaccurate portrayal that reduces their complex reality to a crude sexualized caricature.",
